Package: SplitGenerator
Title: Split Generation Tool for PSO (Marketing Mix Modeling)
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2025-04-27
Authors@R:
  person("Advanced Analytics Colombia", "WPP Media",
         role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
  A Shiny application for generating and validating media
  activity splits used in PSO (Particle Swarm Optimization)
  Marketing Mix Models. Supports all_transformed (national)
  and all_rags (geographic) data sources with interactive
  split merging, diagnosis, and export.
